# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Benchmark results (generated)
tests/benchmarks/results/

# Coverage
tarpaulin-report.html
cobertura.xml
lcov.info

# Rally event logs
.rally/

# Acceptance test reports and artifacts
.acceptance/
.claude/worktrees/

# Local rusty_v8 cache entrypoint populated by .cargo/config.toml.
.cargo/rusty_v8/

# Coverage report artifacts
coverage.html/

# Coverage report
coverage_report/
*.profraw

# Node (chromium screenshot Oracle tooling, DC-14)
# chromium Oracle 截图产物（可由 chromium-oracle-shot.mjs 重新生成，不入库）
tests/wpt-runner/oracle-shots
node_modules/

.local/


# Python bytecode cache (discover/cross-validate scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
product-smoke-cpu.png

# 渲染兼容性评审证据（截图/交叉验证报告，可由 reftest / chromium-oracle-shot.mjs 重新生成）
docs/goal/rendering-compat/evidence/*
# 例外：product-smoke 的 welcome Chromium oracle 是离线质量门禁输入，必须随仓库分发。
!docs/goal/rendering-compat/evidence/product-static/
docs/goal/rendering-compat/evidence/product-static/*
!docs/goal/rendering-compat/evidence/product-static/welcome-chromium.png
# 例外：WPT 趋势基线（绝对数，weekly CI 自动记录并提交回 main——趋势数据应入库）
!docs/goal/rendering-compat/evidence/wpt-trends/

# WPT reftest 数据（上游 web-platform-tests/wpt 子集，~19952 文件，按需 make fetch-wpt-data 拉取）
tests/wpt-runner/wpt-data

.trae
